","englishNameTranslation":"Defrauding","revelationType":"Meccan","numberOfAyahs":36,"ayahs":[{"number":5849,"text":"Woe to those who give less [than due],","numberInSurah":1,"juz":30,"manzil":7,"page":587,"ruku":525,"hizbQuarter":235,"sajda":false},{"number":5850,"text":"Who, when they take a measure from people, take in full.","numberInSurah":2,"juz":30,"manzil":7,"page":587,"ruku":525,"hizbQuarter":235,"sajda":false},{"number":5851,"text":"But if they give by measure or by weight to them, they cause loss.","numberInSurah":3,"juz":30,"manzil":7,"page":587,"ruku":525,"hizbQuarter":235,"sajda":false},{"number":5852,"text":"Do they not think that they will be resurrected","numberInSurah":4,"juz":30,"manzil":7,"page":587,"ruku":525,"hizbQuarter":235,"sajda":false},{"number":5853,"text":"For a tremendous Day -","numberInSurah":5,"juz":30,"manzil":7,"page":587,"ruku":525,"hizbQuarter":235,"sajda":false},{"number":5854,"text":"The Day when mankind will stand before the Lord of the worlds?","numberInSurah":6,"juz":30,"manzil":7,"page":587,"ruku":525,"hizbQuarter":235,"sajda":false},{"number":5855,"text":"No! Indeed, the record of the wicked is in sijjeen.","numberInSurah":7,"juz":30,"manzil":7,"page":588,"ruku":525,"hizbQuarter":235,"sajda":false},{"number":5856,"text":"And what can make you know what is sijjeen?","numberInSurah":8,"juz":30,"manzil":7,"page":588,"ruku":525,"hizbQuarter":235,"sajda":false},{"number":5857,"text":"It is [their destination recorded in] a register inscribed.","numberInSurah":9,"juz":30,"manzil":7,"page":588,"ruku":525,"hizbQuarter":235,"sajda":false},{"number":5858,"text":"Woe, that Day, to the deniers,","numberInSurah":10,"juz":30,"manzil":7,"page":588,"ruku":525,"hizbQuarter":235,"sajda":false},{"number":5859,"text":"Who deny the Day of Recompense.","numberInSurah":11,"juz":30,"manzil":7,"page":588,"ruku":525,"hizbQuarter":235,"sajda":false},{"number":5860,"text":"And none deny it except every sinful transgressor.","numberInSurah":12,"juz":30,"manzil":7,"page":588,"ruku":525,"hizbQuarter":235,"sajda":false},{"number":5861,"text":"When Our verses are recited to him, he says, \"Legends of the former peoples.\"","numberInSurah":13,"juz":30,"manzil":7,"page":588,"ruku":525,"hizbQuarter":235,"sajda":false},{"number":5862,"text":"No! Rather, the stain has covered their hearts of that which they were earning.","numberInSurah":14,"juz":30,"manzil":7,"page":588,"ruku":525,"hizbQuarter":235,"sajda":false},{"number":5863,"text":"No! Indeed, from their Lord, that Day, they will be partitioned.","numberInSurah":15,"juz":30,"manzil":7,"page":588,"ruku":525,"hizbQuarter":235,"sajda":false},{"number":5864,"text":"Then indeed, they will [enter and] burn in Hellfire.","numberInSurah":16,"juz":30,"manzil":7,"page":588,"ruku":525,"hizbQuarter":235,"sajda":false},{"number":5865,"text":"Then it will be said [to them], \"This is what you used to deny.\"","numberInSurah":17,"juz":30,"manzil":7,"page":588,"ruku":525,"hizbQuarter":235,"sajda":false},{"number":5866,"text":"No! Indeed, the record of the righteous is in 'illiyyun.","numberInSurah":18,"juz":30,"manzil":7,"page":588,"ruku":525,"hizbQuarter":235,"sajda":false},{"number":5867,"text":"And what can make you know what is 'illiyyun?","numberInSurah":19,"juz":30,"manzil":7,"page":588,"ruku":525,"hizbQuarter":235,"sajda":false},{"number":5868,"text":"It is [their destination recorded in] a register inscribed","numberInSurah":20,"juz":30,"manzil":7,"page":588,"ruku":525,"hizbQuarter":235,"sajda":false},{"number":5869,"text":"Which is witnessed by those brought near [to Allah].","numberInSurah":21,"juz":30,"manzil":7,"page":588,"ruku":525,"hizbQuarter":235,"sajda":false},{"number":5870,"text":"Indeed, the righteous will be in pleasure","numberInSurah":22,"juz":30,"manzil":7,"page":588,"ruku":525,"hizbQuarter":235,"sajda":false},{"number":5871,"text":"On adorned couches, observing.","numberInSurah":23,"juz":30,"manzil":7,"page":588,"ruku":525,"hizbQuarter":235,"sajda":false},{"number":5872,"text":"You will recognize in their faces the radiance of pleasure.","numberInSurah":24,"juz":30,"manzil":7,"page":588,"ruku":525,"hizbQuarter":235,"sajda":false},{"number":5873,"text":"They will be given to drink [pure] wine [which was] sealed.","numberInSurah":25,"juz":30,"manzil":7,"page":588,"ruku":525,"hizbQuarter":235,"sajda":false},{"number":5874,"text":"The last of it is musk. So for this let the competitors compete.","numberInSurah":26,"juz":30,"manzil":7,"page":588,"ruku":525,"hizbQuarter":235,"sajda":false},{"number":5875,"text":"And its mixture is of Tasneem,","numberInSurah":27,"juz":30,"manzil":7,"page":588,"ruku":525,"hizbQuarter":235,"sajda":false},{"number":5876,"text":"A spring from which those near [to Allah] drink.","numberInSurah":28,"juz":30,"manzil":7,"page":588,"ruku":525,"hizbQuarter":235,"sajda":false},{"number":5877,"text":"Indeed, those who committed crimes used to laugh at those who believed.","numberInSurah":29,"juz":30,"manzil":7,"page":588,"ruku":525,"hizbQuarter":235,"sajda":false},{"number":5878,"text":"And when they passed by them, they would exchange derisive glances.","numberInSurah":30,"juz":30,"manzil":7,"page":588,"ruku":525,"hizbQuarter":235,"sajda":false},{"number":5879,"text":"And when they returned to their people, they would return jesting.","numberInSurah":31,"juz":30,"manzil":7,"page":588,"ruku":525,"hizbQuarter":235,"sajda":false},{"number":5880,"text":"And when they saw them, they would say, \"Indeed, those are truly lost.\"","numberInSurah":32,"juz":30,"manzil":7,"page":588,"ruku":525,"hizbQuarter":235,"sajda":false},{"number":5881,"text":"But they had not been sent as guardians over them.","numberInSurah":33,"juz":30,"manzil":7,"page":588,"ruku":525,"hizbQuarter":235,"sajda":false},{"number":5882,"text":"So Today those who believed are laughing at the disbelievers,","numberInSurah":34,"juz":30,"manzil":7,"page":588,"ruku":525,"hizbQuarter":235,"sajda":false},{"number":5883,"text":"On adorned couches, observing.","numberInSurah":35,"juz":30,"manzil":7,"page":589,"ruku":525,"hizbQuarter":235,"sajda":false},{"number":5884,"text":"Have the disbelievers [not] been rewarded [this Day] for what they used to do?","numberInSurah":36,"juz":30,"manzil":7,"page":589,"ruku":525,"hizbQuarter":235,"sajda":false}],"edition":{"identifier":"en.sahih","language":"en","name":"Saheeh International","englishName":"Saheeh International","format":"text","type":"translation","direction":"ltr"}},{"number":83,"name":"\u0633\u064f\u0648\u0631\u064e\u0629\u064f \u0627\u0644\u0645\u064f\u0637\u064e\u0641\u0651\u0650\u0641\u0650\u064a\u0646\u064e","englishName":"Al-Mutaffifin","englishNameTranslation":"Defrauding","revelationType":"Meccan","numberOfAyahs":36,"ayahs":[{"number":5849,"text":"\u00ab\u0648\u064a\u0644\u00bb \u0643\u0644\u0645\u0629 \u0639\u0630\u0627\u0628\u060c \u0623\u0648 \u0648\u0627\u062f \u0641\u064a \u062c\u0647\u0646\u0645 \u00ab\u0644\u0644\u0645\u0637\u0641\u0641\u064a\u0646\u00bb.","numberInSurah":1,"juz":30,"manzil":7,"page":587,"ruku":525,"hizbQuarter":235,"sajda":false},{"number":5850,"text":"\u00ab\u0627\u0644\u0630\u064a\u0646 \u0625\u0630\u0627 \u0627\u0643\u062a\u0627\u0644\u0648\u0627 \u0639\u0644\u0649\u00bb \u0623\u064a \u0645\u0646 \u00ab\u0627\u0644\u0646\u0627\u0633 \u064a\u0633\u062a\u0648\u0641\u0648\u0646\u00bb \u0627\u0644\u0643\u064a\u0644.","numberInSurah":2,"juz":30,"manzil":7,"page":587,"ruku":525,"hizbQuarter":235,"sajda":false},{"number":5851,"text":"\u00ab\u0648\u0625\u0630\u0627 \u0643\u0627\u0644\u0648\u0647\u0645\u00bb \u0623\u064a \u0643\u0627\u0644\u0648\u0627 \u0644\u0647\u0645 \u00ab\u0623\u0648 \u0648\u0632\u0646\u0648\u0647\u0645\u00bb \u0623\u064a \u0648\u0632\u0646\u0648\u0627 \u0644\u0647\u0645 \u00ab\u064a\u064f\u062e\u0652\u0633\u0650\u0631\u0648\u0646\u00bb \u064a\u0646\u0642\u0635\u0648\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0643\u064a\u0644 \u0623\u0648 \u0627\u0644\u0648\u0632\u0646.","numberInSurah":3,"juz":30,"manzil":7,"page":587,"ruku":525,"hi